  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Divine Consciousness",
          "desc": "Gains enhanced vision and range when leveling up."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Divine Glow - Creation",
          "desc": "Unleashes energy that deals damage, knocks back enemies, and creates a matrix. When the energy stops, it expands to deal extra damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Divine Glow - Coalescence",
          "desc": "Creates a matrix and allows her to teleport. The matrix blocks enemy heroes' movement. Matrices can be fused twice."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Divine Glow - Emergence",
          "desc": "Teleports to the target area after a short delay. Generates a shield, gains Movement Speed, deals damage, and slows the enemy. Passive: Magical Attack can reduce cast time."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Divine Glow - Annihilation",
          "desc": "Deals damage to targets in a straight line across the map."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Insane range",
          "Global Ultimate",
          "Excellent zone control"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Vulnerable to dives",
          "Relies on skill shots",
          "Low mobility"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nNuwa has one of the worst minion clear speeds in early levels. You want to play under the tower and play reactive to where the enemy mid lane is rotating. Rotate the opposite way and try to impact other lanes. When you have access to Skill 3 Emergence, it becomes much easier to roam and helps you get back to mid lane quicker to secure minion gold and experience.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, you want to take control of the fights with your boxes. They can be used for damage, rotations and blocking enemies' path. You have decent self-peel with your knockback, but it can be difficult to land, and with your global Ultimate you can always make an impact in a fight.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nOne-Shot combo - Skill 2 > Skill 2 > Skill 1 > Ultimate\nSkill 2's box can be used to traverse over terrain\nSkill 3 can be used for vision and cancelled so you don't travel"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Push wave cepet biar Nuwa gak gampang ninggalin lane. 2) Skill Nuwa butuh prediksi, pakai dash gampang dihindarin."
    },
